Begin3
Title:          Mpxplay
Version:        1.67
Entered-Date:   2023-06-13
Description:    Plays audio w/ its own built-in modern soundcard drivers: AAC,
                AC3, APE, FLAC, MP2/MP3, MPC, OGG (VORBIS), WMA, WAV, WV, CDW.
Keywords:       mp3, ogg, vorbis, wav, music, speaker, sound, blaster
Author:         PDSoft (Attila Padar)
Maintained-By:  PDSoft (Attila Padar) mpxplay@freemail.hu
Primary-Site:   http://mpxplay.sourceforge.net
Original-Site:  http://mpxplay.cjb.net/
Platforms:      DOS 5+ (OpenWatcom 1.9), Win32 (console)
Copying-Policy: Source code available (open)
End
